      "text": {
        "jp": "だからアルシャに見せてやりたいんだ。\r\n俺が守り人の使命を果たし、\r\n立派な水の守り人と認められるところを。",
        "official_en": "That is why I want to show Arsha who I can really be. I want her to see me fulfill my duty and earn the reputation of being a fully-fledged Warden.",
        "real_en": "I want Arsha to see me fulfill my duty and be recognized as a worthy Warden of Water."
      },
