      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はい。\r\n水華のヴェリアスというものによって\r\n街が洪水に飲まれようとしています。",
        "official_en": "Yes. A being known as Alluvion has flooded the city. If we don’t act quickly, all will be swept away.",
        "real_en": "Yes. Water Bloom Veritas is about to engulf the city in a flood."
