      "text": {
        "jp": "水の守り人として、自分のできることを精一杯やる。\r\nそれでいいじゃないか。\r\nニコルやルルカと比べることじゃないって。",
        "official_en": "What matters is that you give your all for the sake of others, as a Warden. That’s all you can do. C’mon, don’t compare yourself to Nichol or Luka.",
        "real_en": "As a Warden of Water, just do everything you can. That’s enough. Don’t compare yourself to Nichol or Ruruka."
